{"id":"california-daydream","v":1,"lines":[{"t0":9.36,"t1":14.28,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The sun was falling through the trees,","w":[[9.36,9.76],[9.76,10.16],[10.16,10.56],[10.56,11.36],[11.36,11.52],[11.52,12.18],[12.18,13.08]]},{"t0":16.6,"t1":22.16,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The radio was singing to the breeze.","w":[[16.6,17],[17,17.68],[17.68,18.24],[18.24,19.4],[19.4,19.84],[19.84,20.28],[20.28,20.96]]},{"t0":23.3,"t1":27.54,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"We had no map, we had no plans,","w":[[23.3,23.6],[23.6,23.84],[23.84,24.53],[24.53,25.46],[25.46,25.58],[25.58,25.88],[25.88,26.28],[26.28,26.98]]},{"t0":27.54,"t1":31.5,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Just a little hope and a little sand.","w":[[27.54,27.7],[27.7,28.18],[28.18,28.46],[28.46,28.94],[28.94,29.46],[29.46,29.74],[29.74,30.44],[30.44,31.22]]},{"t0":31.5,"t1":35.54,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Your old blue jacket, my bare feet,","w":[[31.5,31.76],[31.76,32.12],[32.12,32.52],[32.52,33.16],[33.16,33.8],[33.8,34.28],[34.28,34.86]]},{"t0":35.54,"t1":39.56,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"A dusty road and a summer beat.","w":[[35.54,35.68],[35.68,36.18],[36.18,36.8],[36.8,37.54],[37.54,37.7],[37.7,38.16],[38.16,38.82]]},{"t0":39.56,"t1":43.26,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"The sky was gold, the world was wide,","w":[[39.56,39.66],[39.66,40.08],[40.08,40.5],[40.5,41.56],[41.56,41.72],[41.72,42.18],[42.18,42.52],[42.52,43.02]]},{"t0":43.26,"t1":47.12,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"And we had nothing we needed to hide.","w":[[43.26,43.52],[43.52,43.8],[43.8,44.4],[44.4,45.19],[45.19,45.48],[45.48,46.18],[46.18,46.56],[46.56,47.1]]},{"t0":47.12,"t1":54.82,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Take me back to that California daydream,","w":[[47.12,48.1],[48.1,48.52],[48.52,49.04],[49.04,50.28],[50.28,50.54],[50.54,52.88],[52.88,53.62]]},{"t0":55.74,"t1":61.46,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Where the world was bigger than it seemed.","w":[[55.74,56.34],[56.34,56.6],[56.6,57.68],[57.68,58.82],[58.82,59.32],[59.32,59.92],[59.92,60.38],[60.38,61.44]]},{"t0":61.46,"t1":67.04,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Where the nights were warm and the stars shone bright,","w":[[61.46,63.4],[63.4,63.58],[63.58,64.2],[64.2,64.68],[64.68,65.2],[65.2,65.44],[65.44,65.72],[65.72,66.08],[66.08,66.56],[66.56,67.02]]},{"t0":67.04,"t1":70.94,"sec":"Chorus","text":"And we never had to say goodbye.","w":[[67.04,68.1],[68.1,68.36],[68.36,68.78],[68.78,69.24],[69.24,69.62],[69.62,70.02],[70.02,70.92]]},{"t0":70.94,"t1":75.1,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Oh, take me back, just for a while,","w":[[70.94,72.08],[72.08,72.22],[72.22,72.56],[72.56,73.1],[73.1,74.18],[74.18,74.48],[74.48,74.72],[74.72,75.08]]},{"t0":75.1,"t1":82.14,"sec":"Chorus","text":"To the endless roads and your crooked smile.","w":[[75.1,75.7],[75.7,76],[76,76.48],[76.48,78.3],[78.3,79.52],[79.52,79.82],[79.82,80.4],[80.4,80.94]]},{"t0":89.3,"t1":94.46,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"The years rolled on like the ocean tide,","w":[[89.3,89.7],[89.7,90.3],[90.3,91],[91,91.3],[91.3,91.86],[91.86,92.12],[92.12,92.68],[92.68,93.26]]},{"t0":96.62,"t1":102.82,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"We found new roads on the other side.","w":[[96.62,96.92],[96.92,98.38],[98.38,98.84],[98.84,99.52],[99.52,99.92],[99.92,100.18],[100.18,100.64],[100.64,101.62]]},{"t0":103.74,"t1":111.62,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"But sometimes a song on a late-night drive","w":[[103.74,104.1],[104.1,104.72],[104.72,105.18],[105.18,107.54],[107.54,107.94],[107.94,108.64],[108.64,109.64],[109.64,110.42]]},{"t0":112.06,"t1":119.52,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Brings those summer days back to life.","w":[[112.06,112.42],[112.42,112.84],[112.84,113.8],[113.8,114.42],[114.42,116.56],[116.56,117],[117,118.32]]},{"t0":121.58,"t1":124.88,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Maybe time is just a passing train,","w":[[121.58,122.18],[122.18,122.6],[122.6,122.84],[122.84,123.08],[123.08,123.3],[123.3,123.8],[123.8,124.86]]},{"t0":124.88,"t1":128.84,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Maybe sunshine always follows rain.","w":[[124.88,126.18],[126.18,126.86],[126.86,127.8],[127.8,128.24],[128.24,128.82]]},{"t0":128.84,"t1":134,"sec":"Bridge","text":"And somewhere underneath this changing sky,","w":[[128.84,129.34],[129.34,129.86],[129.86,131.28],[131.28,132.02],[132.02,132.82],[132.82,133.96]]},{"t0":134,"t1":139.2,"sec":"Bridge","text":"That younger me is still alive.","w":[[134,134.5],[134.5,135.24],[135.24,135.52],[135.52,136.5],[136.5,136.76],[136.76,138]]},{"t0":148.38,"t1":155.76,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Take me back to that California daydream,","w":[[148.38,148.88],[148.88,149.26],[149.26,150],[150,151.06],[151.06,151.89],[151.89,153.72],[153.72,154.56]]},{"t0":156.6,"t1":163.1,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Where the world was bigger than it seemed.","w":[[156.6,157.2],[157.2,157.44],[157.44,158.58],[158.58,159.66],[159.66,160.12],[160.12,160.74],[160.74,161.24],[161.24,161.9]]},{"t0":163.64,"t1":168.6,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Where the nights were warm and the stars shone bright,","w":[[163.64,164.24],[164.24,164.46],[164.46,165.08],[165.08,165.46],[165.46,165.94],[165.94,166.3],[166.3,166.48],[166.48,166.98],[166.98,167.44],[167.44,167.86]]},{"t0":168.6,"t1":173.12,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"And we thought forever was ours that night.","w":[[168.6,168.8],[168.8,169],[169,169.36],[169.36,170.02],[170.02,170.7],[170.7,171.08],[171.08,171.46],[171.46,171.92]]}],"gloss":[{"w":"daydream","m":{"en":"happy thoughts and pictures in your mind while you are awake","tr":"hayal, gündüz düşü","fa":"خیال‌پردازی، رؤیای بیداری","es":"ensoñación, sueño despierto"},"at":[[8,"daydream"],[22,"daydream"]]},{"w":"breeze","m":{"en":"a light, gentle wind","tr":"esinti, meltem","fa":"نسیم","es":"brisa"},"at":[[1,"breeze"]]},{"w":"take me back","m":{"en":"make me go back to an old time or place","tr":"beni geri götür","fa":"منو برگردون","es":"llévame de vuelta"},"at":[[8,"Take me back"],[12,"take me back"],[22,"Take me back"]]},{"w":"crooked smile","m":{"en":"a smile that goes up more on one side","tr":"yamuk gülüş","fa":"لبخندِ کج","es":"sonrisa torcida"},"at":[[13,"crooked s